      "writtenOn": "2018-06-27T20:11:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027d recommend we run VOLTHA using k8s rather than the older docker-compose way of running things. Using k8s will allow us to control things using REST APIs on k8s, rather than driving docker-compose through CLI.",
